<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 11/12.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 11/12.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>11/12. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 11/12	  June 10/11</p>
<p> CZK	0.42598		0.42627</p>
<p> DKK	2.10113		2.10106</p>
<p> FIM	2.66123		2.66425</p>
<p> HUF	0.07461		0.0746</p>
<p> JPY	0.12345		0.12131</p>
<p> LTL	3.42379		3.41953</p>
<p> LVL     24.20857	     24.07815</p>
<p> RUR	0.00238		0.00237</p>
<p> SEK	1.76514		1.75773</p>
<p> UAH	7.39405		7.37367</p>
<p> USD     13.696		  13.68</p>
<p> XEU     15.56345		15.57126</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
